  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is moving in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>-plane such that its velocity at a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is given as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is a non-zero constant. What is the force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;acting on the particle?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>As force is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>, where velocity along x-axis is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;velocity along y-axis is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math>.</p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Therefore, required value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
